  "prefLabel": "Den 301.07 Military Service Active License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 301.07 Military Service Active License. Active dental or dental hygiene licensure shall be granted to persons holding an inactive New Hampshire dental or dental hygiene license while on active military duty, upon request by the licensee.\n\nSource. #8260, eff 1-19-05 (from Saf-C 301.06); ss by #8838, eff 3-9-07; renumbered by #10068 (from Den 301.08); ss by #10794, eff 3-7-15; renumbered by #14187 (formerly Den 301.10)",
